  "description": "Road bike or All-Road bike? Why choose?\n\nOur flagship model, Strael, now in its fourth iteration, has been crowned road.cc Road Bike of the Year 2025/26 and All-Road Bike of the Year 2025/26 – an unprecedented double. Designed for tarmac-focused, year-round riding in all conditions, but with enough tyre clearance to take the sting out of broken, imperfect roads.\n\nThis frame is the culmination of a 2 year collaboration with Reynolds Technology. New tooling created from scratch. Making an entirely new tube set for this frame: ‘853 Road DZB’. Resulting in a lighter and stronger frame.\n\nIt’s a fantastic product that showcases what is possible with the material, while offering unrivalled functionality and detailing.\n\n“The closest bike to perfection I have ever ridden.” – Stu Kerton – Senior Product Reviewer – Road.cc – 5 STARS – June 2025.\n\n“It’s a perfect bike.” – Will Jones – Senior Tech Writer – Cycling News – 5 STARS – September 2025.\n\n“The Strael 4.0 is in a class of one.” – Ashley Quinlan – Road Tech Lead – Bike Radar – 5 STARS – November 2025.",
